Description
🚀 Senior Data Engineer – Mindera

At Mindera, we leverage technology to build high-impact products that transform businesses. Our Data Engineering team plays a crucial role in enabling data-driven decisions by building scalable, reliable, and efficient data platforms.

As a Senior Data Engineer, you will work on designing and building robust data solutions that power analytics, machine learning, and real-time data applications. You’ll collaborate closely with cross-functional teams including Data Scientists, Machine Learning Engineers, and Product teams to deliver high-quality data products.

Requirements
🧠 What We’re Looking For
Strong hands-on experience in Python and SQL
Proven experience in building data pipelines for analytics and ML workloads
Strong understanding of data modelling, data warehousing, and data lakes
Hands-on experience with tools like Spark, Airflow, DBT, or similar
Experience working with cloud platforms (AWS preferred)
Experience with modern data formats such as Parquet and Iceberg
Experience with both batch and real-time data processing
Knowledge of CI/CD practices (Jenkins, GitHub Actions)
Experience with Infrastructure as Code (Terraform) and containerization (Docker)
Understanding of Vector Databases (e.g., Pinecone, Weaviate, or similar)
Experience with Embeddings, including text or image embeddings and semantic search use cases
Basic to intermediate knowledge of Machine Learning concepts and pipelines
Eligibility to work in India
🌟 Nice to Have
Experience working with feature stores and ML pipelines
Exposure to streaming technologies (Kafka, Kinesis, etc.)
Understanding of data governance and data quality frameworks
Experience with LLM-based applications
Benefits
We offer
Flexible working hours (self-managed)
Annual bonus, subject to company performance
Access to Udemy online training and opportunities to learn and grow within the role
At Mindera we use technology to build products we are proud of, with people we love.

Software Engineering Applications, including Web and Mobile, are at the core of what we do at Mindera.

We partner with our clients, to understand their products and deliver high-performance, resilient and scalable software systems that create an impact on their users and businesses across the world.

You get to work with a bunch of great people, and the whole team owns the project together.

Our culture reflects our lean and self-organisation attitude.

We encourage our colleagues to take risks, make decisions, work in a collaborative way and talk to everyone to enhance communication. We are proud of our work and we love to learn all and everything while navigating through an Agile, Lean and collaborative environment.

